# CODEOWNERS — automatic review routing for `intp`.
#
# Format documented at:
#   https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Review rule: every PR needs at least one approval from a code owner
# of the touched area. Owners are also pinged automatically. The
# authoritative roster is in /MAINTAINERS; this file routes reviews,
# /MAINTAINERS records who can merge.
#
# Keep entries from most-general (top) to most-specific (bottom);
# the last matching pattern wins.

